Leap onto an adjacent target with your shield, striking them for [217%, 244%, 266%, 284%, 300% (TL1-5)] damage and dazing them for 2 turns, then using them as a springboard to leap to a tile within range [3, 3, 4, 4, 5 (TL1-5)].

The shield bash will use Dexterity instead of Strength for the shield's bonus damage.

At talent level 5, you will immediately enter a blocking stance on landing.
